<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n97374" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στύγος</span></b>  [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῠ], <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εος</span>, τό</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>hatred</i>, <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Ch.</u>
				392
			</span></i> (lyr.); esp. as expressed in looks, <i>sullenness,
			gloom</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ δύσφρον ς</span>. <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Ag.</u>
				547
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φρενῶν ς</span>. ib.<i><span class="en">
				1308
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Ch.</u>
				81
			</span></i> (lyr.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>object of hatred, abomination</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Ag.</u>
				558
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				A.R.
				4.445
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>AP</u>
				7.405
			</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
				Phil.
			</span></i>); of persons, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δεσπότου ς</span>.
			thy <i>hated</i> lord, <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Ch.</u>
				770
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στύγη θεῶν</span>, of the
			Erinyes, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Eu.</u>
				644
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>Th.</u>
				653
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Ch.</u>
				1028
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοῦτ᾽ ἐμήσατο ς</span>. this
				<i>deed of horror</i>, ib.<i><span class="en">
				999(991)
			</span></i>. Rare, exc. in <i><span class="en">
				A.
			</span></i></div>
